		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Bonjour</p><p>voici les commande :<br />sur le master :<br />archive_command = &#039;cp %p /opt/postgres/9.0/data/pg_wal/%f&#039;<br />sur la standbye<br />restore_command = &#039;cp /opt/postgres/9.0/data/pg_wal/%f &quot;%p&quot;&#039;</p>]]></content>
